Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-webkit-6.0
Maintainer: Alexandru Bichis <alex.bichis@gmail.com>
Description: Simple Markdown viewer for GNOME
 Opens Markdown files in a clean GNOME window that follows the system
 light or dark style. Supports tables, task lists, syntax-highlighted
 code and reloads automatically when the file changes.
